  },
  "content": "\n      <section id=\"shopify-section-template--21006359167144__main\" class=\"shopify-section section\"><link href=\"//namonarayana.com/cdn/shop/t/8/assets/section-main-page.css?v=171954480266013350391783682218\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\">\n<style data-shopify=\"\">.section-template--21006359167144__main-padding {\n    padding-top: 27px;\n    padding-bottom: 0px;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {\n    .section-template--21006359167144__main-padding {\n      padding-top: 36px;\n      padding-bottom: 0px;\n    }\n  }</style><div class=\"page-width page-width--narrow section-template--21006359167144__main-padding\">\n  <h1 class=\"main-page-title page-title h0 scroll-trigger animate--fade-in\">\n    Contact\n  </h1>\n  <div class=\"rte scroll-trigger animate--slide-in\">\n    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>\n<p>We'd love to hear from you! Whether you have a question about our products, need help with an order, or just want to say hello — we're here for you.</p>\n<h3>Customer Support</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:namonarayanadev@gmail.com\">namonarayanadev@gmail.com</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Response Time:</strong> We typically respond within 24 hours (Mon–Sat, 10 AM – 7 PM IST)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Order Related Queries</h3>\n<p>For questions about your order status, shipping, returns, or refunds, please email us with your <strong>Order ID</strong> and we'll get back to you promptly.</p>\n<h3>Business &amp; Partnerships</h3>\n<p>For bulk orders, wholesale enquiries, collaborations, or media requests, write to us at <a href=\"mailto:namonarayanadev@gmail.com\">namonarayanadev@gmail.com</a> with the subject line \"Business Enquiry\".</p>\n<h3>Registered Office</h3>\n<p><strong>Namo Narayana</strong><br>India</p>\n<h3>Grievance Officer</h3>\n<p>In accordance with the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020, the details of our Grievance Officer are as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Name:</strong> Namo Narayana</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:namonarayanadev@gmail.com\">namonarayanadev@gmail.com</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Response Time:</strong> All grievances will be acknowledged within 48 hours and resolved within 30 days.</li>\n</ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n</section><section id=\"shopify-section-template--21006359167144__form\" class=\"shopify-section section\"><link href=\"//namonarayana.com/cdn/shop/t/8/assets/section-contact-form.css?v=49807578925852721501783682229\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\">\n<style data-shopify=\"\">.section-template--21006359167144__form-padding {\n    padding-top: 0px;\n    padding-bottom: 45px;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {\n    .section-template--21006359167144__form-padding {\n      padding-top: 0px;\n      padding-bottom: 60px;\n    }\n  }</style><div class=\"color-scheme-1 gradient\">\n  <div class=\"contact page-width page-width--narrow section-template--21006359167144__form-padding\"><h2 class=\"visually-hidden\">Contact form</h2><form method=\"post\" action=\"/contact#ContactForm\" id=\"ContactForm\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" class=\"isolate scroll-trigger animate--slide-in\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_type\" value=\"contact\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"utf8\" value=\"✓\"><div class=\"contact__fields\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <input class=\"field__input\" autocomplete=\"name\" type=\"text\" id=\"ContactForm-name\" name=\"contact[Name]\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Name\">\n          <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"ContactForm-name\">Name</label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field field--with-error\">\n          <input autocomplete=\"email\" type=\"email\" id=\"ContactForm-email\" class=\"field__input\" name=\"contact[email]\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocapitalize=\"off\" value=\"\" aria-required=\"true\" placeholder=\"Email\">\n          <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"ContactForm-email\">Email\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <input type=\"tel\" id=\"ContactForm-phone\" class=\"field__input\" autocomplete=\"tel\" name=\"contact[Phone number]\" pattern=\"[0-9\\-]*\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Phone number\">\n        <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"ContactForm-phone\">Phone number</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <textarea rows=\"10\" id=\"ContactForm-body\" class=\"text-area field__input\" name=\"contact[Comment]\" placeholder=\"Comment\"></textarea>\n        <label class=\"form__label field__label\" for=\"ContactForm-body\">Comment</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"contact__button\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"button\">\n          Send\n        </button>\n      </div></form></div>\n</div>\n\n\n</section>\n    "
}